              <p>Many companies can arrive, perform a test, produce a report, and move on to the next property. Red Rocks Fire Protection Services takes a different approach. Our goal is to become a long-term life safety partner who understands your facility, your systems, your inspection history, and the recurring requirements that need to be managed over time.</p>
              <p>Because inspection and testing frequencies can vary by system, adopted code edition, manufacturer requirements, and Authority Having Jurisdiction (AHJ), we review each property individually rather than applying a one-size-fits-all schedule. Whether we are coordinating annual inspections, identifying an upcoming 3-year requirement, planning 5-year sprinkler testing, tracking deficiencies, or helping manage multiple locations, our team focuses on giving clients a clearer picture of their overall compliance responsibilities.</p>
