              <p>Managing fire and life safety compliance can become complicated quickly. Different systems may require annual, semi-annual, quarterly, 3-year, or 5-year inspections and testing. Deficiencies may require follow-up repairs. Building changes, system age, adopted codes, and jurisdictional requirements can affect what is required and when.</p>
