              <p>Fire and life safety inspections require more than knowing how to test one type of system. Properties can contain fire sprinkler systems, fire alarm systems, fire extinguishers, fire pumps, backflow prevention assemblies, ERRCS/BDA systems, Area of Refuge communication systems, elevator emergency communication systems, kitchen hood suppression systems, and other applicable life safety equipment — each with its own inspection, testing, documentation, and maintenance requirements.</p>
              <p>Red Rocks Fire Protection Services brings that broad system expertise together under one roof. Our NICET-certified technicians and experienced team help clients coordinate recurring requirements, document deficiencies, identify corrective actions, and plan for future testing. That breadth is especially valuable for commercial and multifamily properties and for management companies responsible for multiple locations.</p>
